# CodeSense AI — Netlify routing
# 1) Same-origin API proxy to the Render backend (must precede the SPA
#    fallback). Keeps the session cookie first-party on the Netlify origin,
#    so SameSite=Lax applies and CSRF headers pass through unchanged.
/api/*  https://codesense-ai-backend-9skh.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# 2) SPA fallback for client-side routes.
/*  /index.html  200
